{"seq":3,"slug":"transfer-contract-approval","title":"传输合同审批与签署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-data-transfer-compliance/tia-dpia-workflow/transfer-contract-approval","wordCount":2363,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"传输合同审批与签署\">传输合同审批与签署</h1><p>TIA 出了结论、接收方核验完成，剩下的动作看起来只是「签一份合同」。但如果合同是一个 Word 文档在邮件里流转签字，前面所有工作都会在这最后一步漏掉：核验结论里要求加的审计条款没加上、TIA 要求的技术补充措施没写进去、签完没有备案、续期时间没人管。合同管理的要点是把它从<strong>文书流程</strong>变成<strong>参数化生成 + 状态机驱动</strong>的工程流程——模板固定、变量受控、每个状态有明确的进入条件与后续动作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-合同是评估结论的序列化产物\">核心概念：合同是评估结论的序列化产物</h2><p>合同不是独立于评估存在的文书，它是 TIA 结论、核验结论、机制判定的<strong>序列化结果</strong>。因此生成合同不应当从空白模板开始，而应当从一次结构化输入开始。这一判断有法律依据：SCC 是欧盟委员会「预先批准」的示范条款，2021 年 6 月 4 日通过的实施决定 (EU) 2021/914 给出了现行文本，取代了依 95/46 指令通过的三套旧条款（<a href=\"https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-topic/data-protection/international-dimension-data-protection/standard-contractual-clauses-scc_en\">Standard Contractual Clauses</a>）。既然条款文本由监管机构预先批准，企业的自由度就只存在于<strong>填充哪些条款、填什么参数</strong>，而不在于改写条款本身——这正是把合同做成「模板 + 受控参数」而非自由起草的根本原因。</p>\n<p>中国法域下标准合同的形态相同：《个人信息出境标准合同办法》要求合同按官方附件订立，约定其他条款不得与标准合同冲突，且标准合同生效后方可开展个人信息出境活动（<a href=\"https://www.cac.gov.cn/2023-02/24/c_1678884830036813.htm\">个人信息出境标准合同办法</a>）。两个法域在这一点上收敛到同一个工程结论：<strong>合同文本是常量，合同参数是变量</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  I1[机制判定&lt;br/&gt;第一章矩阵] --&gt; G[合同参数装配]&#10;  I2[TIA 结论&lt;br/&gt;要素与措施] --&gt; G&#10;  I3[接收方核验&lt;br/&gt;角色与能力] --&gt; G&#10;  I4[出境清单&lt;br/&gt;链路与字段] --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; T[选择模板 + 模块]&#10;  T --&gt; C[生成条款实例]&#10;  C --&gt; A[审批链路]&#10;  A --&gt; S[签署]&#10;  S --&gt; F[备案/登记]&#10;  F --&gt; E[生效 + 排定续期]\">graph TD\n  I1[机制判定&lt;br/&gt;第一章矩阵] --&gt; G[合同参数装配]\n  I2[TIA 结论&lt;br/&gt;要素与措施] --&gt; G\n  I3[接收方核验&lt;br/&gt;角色与能力] --&gt; G\n  I4[出境清单&lt;br/&gt;链路与字段] --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; T[选择模板 + 模块]\n  T --&gt; C[生成条款实例]\n  C --&gt; A[审批链路]\n  A --&gt; S[签署]\n  S --&gt; F[备案/登记]\n  F --&gt; E[生效 + 排定续期]</pre><p>四个输入里，<code>出境清单</code> 的作用是把「数据范围」写进合同。一份 SCC 若只笼统写「个人数据」，在争议时无法界定范围；把清单里的链路与字段引用写进附录，合同的范围就与系统里实际传输的内容对齐了。这也是为什么清单必须能给出稳定的链路标识——合同附录引用的是这个标识。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参数化模板与模块化条款\">参数化模板与模块化条款</h2><p>参数化生成的核心是把合同拆成两层：<strong>不可变的核心条款</strong>与<strong>受控的可变参数</strong>。核心条款不允许通过谈判豁免（例如 SCC 中关于政府访问请求的异议义务），可变参数则必须由评估结论驱动。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;template&quot;: &quot;EU-SCC-2021-914&quot;,&#10;  &quot;module&quot;: &quot;m2&quot;,&#10;  &quot;parties&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;exporter&quot;: { &quot;entityId&quot;: 10021, &quot;role&quot;: &quot;controller&quot;, &quot;cc&quot;: &quot;DE&quot; },&#10;    &quot;importer&quot;: { &quot;entityId&quot;: 40877, &quot;role&quot;: &quot;processor&quot;, &quot;cc&quot;: &quot;US&quot; },&#10;    &quot;dockParties&quot;: []&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;dataScope&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;paths&quot;: [&quot;order-service→risk-api-us&quot;],&#10;    &quot;categories&quot;: [&quot;personal&quot;, &quot;sensitive_personal&quot;],&#10;    &quot;subjects&quot;: [&quot;customer&quot;],&#10;    &quot;maxSubjectsPerYear&quot;: 250000&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;parameters&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;breachNotificationHours&quot;: 12,&#10;    &quot;auditRight&quot;: true,&#10;    &quot;onwardTransferMode&quot;: &quot;prior_written&quot;,&#10;    &quot;governingLawClause&quot;: &quot;member_state&quot;,&#10;    &quot;supervisoryAuthority&quot;: &quot;DE_BERLIN&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;immutableClauses&quot;: [&#10;    &quot;clause_14_transfer_impact_notification&quot;,&#10;    &quot;clause_15_objection_to_authority_access&quot;,&#10;    &quot;clause_8_data_subject_rights&quot;,&#10;    &quot;clause_16_non_compliance_suspension&quot;&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;appendices&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;technical_measures&quot;, &quot;ref&quot;: &quot;TIA-2026-0417&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;authorised_subprocessors&quot;, &quot;ref&quot;: &quot;IMPORTER-40877-2026&quot; }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"template\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EU-SCC-2021-914\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"m2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"parties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"exporter\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"entityId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10021</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"controller\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"cc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"importer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"entityId\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">40877</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"processor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"cc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dockParties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"dataScope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"paths\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"order-service→risk-api-us\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"categories\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"personal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sensitive_personal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"subjects\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"customer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"maxSubjectsPerYear\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">250000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"parameters\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"breachNotificationHours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"auditRight\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"onwardTransferMode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"prior_written\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"governingLawClause\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"member_state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"supervisoryAuthority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE_BERLIN\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"immutableClauses\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"clause_14_transfer_impact_notification\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"clause_15_objection_to_authority_access\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"clause_8_data_subject_rights\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"clause_16_non_compliance_suspension\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"appendices\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"technical_measures\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TIA-2026-0417\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"authorised_subprocessors\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"IMPORTER-40877-2026\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三处设计细节值得展开。第一，<code>immutableClauses</code> 是一份白名单：条款生成器只接受列表内的条款 ID 作为不可变项，任何试图从合同中移除它们的操作都会被拒绝。这对应 <a href=\"../transfer-mechanism-config/scc-bcr-adequacy-eu\">欧盟 SCC/BCR/充分性认定</a> 里「异议义务不允许通过谈判豁免」的判断。第二，<code>parameters.breachNotificationHours</code> 的取值来自接收方核验记录的 <code>breach_notify_hours</code>，而不是谈判结果——核验说 12 小时就写 12 小时，谈判要改必须先改核验。第三，<code>appendices</code> 用引用而不是正文嵌入，使得技术措施清单与分包商清单可以在不重签主合同的情况下更新（这正是对接条款要解决的场景）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模块选择必须与角色一致\">模块选择必须与角色一致</h3><h3 id=\"模块选择必须与角色一致\">模块选择必须与角色一致</h3><p>模块是参数里最不能错的一项。SCC 的四个模块按双方角色组合选用，角色来自接收方核验的 <code>importer_role</code>。把角色到模块的映射写成受约束的枚举，可以避免「用模块二处理控制者关系」这类结构性错误。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE contract_instance (&#10;  contract_id     BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  template        TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  module          TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (module IN (&#39;m1&#39;,&#39;m2&#39;,&#39;m3&#39;,&#39;m4&#39;)),&#10;  exporter_entity BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES importer_entity(entity_id),&#10;  importer_entity BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES importer_entity(entity_id),&#10;  verification_id BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES importer_verification(verification_id),&#10;  tia_id          BIGINT REFERENCES tia_assessment(tia_id),&#10;  status          TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (status IN&#10;                    (&#39;draft&#39;,&#39;in_review&#39;,&#39;approved&#39;,&#39;signed&#39;,&#39;filed&#39;,&#39;active&#39;,&#39;terminated&#39;,&#39;expired&#39;)),&#10;  signed_at       TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  effective_at    TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  filed_at        TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  expires_at      DATE,&#10;  -- 模块必须与核验得到的角色一致&#10;  CHECK (module = CASE (&#10;           SELECT importer_role FROM importer_verification v&#10;           WHERE v.verification_id = verification_id)&#10;         WHEN &#39;controller&#39; THEN &#39;m1&#39;&#10;         WHEN &#39;processor&#39;  THEN &#39;m2&#39;&#10;         WHEN &#39;sub_processor&#39; THEN &#39;m3&#39;&#10;         END OR module = &#39;m4&#39;)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> contract_instance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  contract_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  template        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  module          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (module </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'m1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'m2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'m3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'m4'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  exporter_entity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> importer_entity(entity_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  importer_entity </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> importer_entity(entity_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  verification_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> importer_verification(verification_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tia_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tia_assessment(tia_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'draft'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'in_review'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'approved'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'signed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'filed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'terminated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'expired'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  signed_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  filed_at        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expires_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 模块必须与核验得到的角色一致</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (module </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CASE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> importer_role </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> importer_verification v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">verification_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> verification_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'controller'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'm1'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'processor'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'm2'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sub_processor'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'm3'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> module </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'm4'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条 <code>CHECK</code> 表达的是一个跨表不变量：合同模块必须与核验记录中的角色匹配（模块四作为处理者出口、控制者进口的组合单独放行）。把它放在数据库层而不是应用层，是因为合同状态会被多个系统写入——法务系统、采购系统、以及人工订正——任何一条路径绕过校验都会产生一份结构上不合法的合同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"审批链路-谁必须签-以及为什么\">审批链路：谁必须签，以及为什么</h2><p>审批链路的构成由三个因素决定：出境的机制类型、数据的最严分类、以及是否涉及集团外主体。机制越强、分类越严、主体越外部，审批层级越多。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>最严分类</th>\n<th>审批层级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>集团内子公司</td>\n<td>BCR 覆盖</td>\n<td>个人数据</td>\n<td>法务 + 数据保护负责人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部处理者</td>\n<td>SCC 模块二</td>\n<td>个人数据</td>\n<td>法务 + 安全 + 数据保护负责人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部处理者</td>\n<td>SCC 模块二</td>\n<td>敏感个人信息</td>\n<td>上述 + 业务负责人 + 合规委员会</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部控制者</td>\n<td>SCC 模块一</td>\n<td>敏感个人信息</td>\n<td>上述 + 首席隐私官</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重要数据出境</td>\n<td>安全评估</td>\n<td>重要数据</td>\n<td>全部层级 + 报送外部主管机构</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行说明了为什么审批链路必须能引用机制类型：重要数据出境的审批不能止于内部签署，它必须包含一次对外申报，而申报本身有材料与时限要求（中国法域下标准合同需在生效后 10 个工作日内备案，见 <a href=\"../transfer-mechanism-config/china-outbound-security-scc\">中国出境安全评估/标准合同/认证</a>）。把「备案」建模为签署之后的一个<strong>必须完成的后续状态</strong>，而不是一个可选动作，是让合同状态机覆盖完整生命周期的关键。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"approval_chain(mech, category, external):&#10;  chain = [&quot;legal&quot;]&#10;  if mech in (&quot;scc&quot;,&quot;bcr&quot;,&quot;security_assessment&quot;): chain += [&quot;dpo&quot;]&#10;  if mech == &quot;scc&quot; and external:                  chain += [&quot;security&quot;]&#10;  if category == &quot;sensitive_personal&quot;:            chain += [&quot;business_owner&quot;]&#10;  if category == &quot;important&quot;:                     chain += [&quot;compliance_committee&quot;,&quot;cpo&quot;]&#10;  if mech == &quot;security_assessment&quot;:               chain += [&quot;regulator_filing&quot;]&#10;  return dedupe_preserve_order(chain)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>approval_chain(mech, category, external):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  chain = [\"legal\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if mech in (\"scc\",\"bcr\",\"security_assessment\"): chain += [\"dpo\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if mech == \"scc\" and external:                  chain += [\"security\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if category == \"sensitive_personal\":            chain += [\"business_owner\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if category == \"important\":                     chain += [\"compliance_committee\",\"cpo\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if mech == \"security_assessment\":               chain += [\"regulator_filing\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return dedupe_preserve_order(chain)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>审批链路里一个常见的失效模式是<strong>并行审批导致的结论不一致</strong>：法务按模块二审、安全按「接收方持密钥」提出补充措施、而合同已按不含该措施生成。避免方式是让审批节点消费同一份参数快照，任何节点提出的修改都产生一个新版本的 <code>contract_instance</code> 并重启审批，而不是在原对象上打补丁。版本化在这里不只是审计需求，它是保证「签字的那一版等于评审的那一版」的机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"变更-续期与终止\">变更、续期与终止</h2><p>合同生效不是终点。三类事件会推动状态迁移，每一类都要有明确的处理路径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; draft&#10;  draft --&gt; in_review: 提交审批&#10;  in_review --&gt; approved: 全部节点通过&#10;  approved --&gt; signed: 双方签署&#10;  signed --&gt; filed: 备案/申报完成&#10;  filed --&gt; active: 生效&#10;  active --&gt; in_review: 参数变更(新版本)&#10;  active --&gt; expired: 到期未续&#10;  active --&gt; terminated: 提前终止&#10;  expired --&gt; [*]&#10;  terminated --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; draft\n  draft --&gt; in_review: 提交审批\n  in_review --&gt; approved: 全部节点通过\n  approved --&gt; signed: 双方签署\n  signed --&gt; filed: 备案/申报完成\n  filed --&gt; active: 生效\n  active --&gt; in_review: 参数变更(新版本)\n  active --&gt; expired: 到期未续\n  active --&gt; terminated: 提前终止\n  expired --&gt; [*]\n  terminated --&gt; [*]</pre><h3 id=\"变更按影响面分流\">变更按影响面分流</h3><p><strong>变更</strong>分两类：影响数据范围或接收方的变更必须重新走完整流程（因为 TIA 与核验结论可能失效），而仅影响商务条款（费用、期限）的变更只需重新签署。区分标准可以写得很明确：涉及 <code>dataScope</code> 或 <code>importer_entity</code> 或 <code>module</code> 的变更走完整流程，其余走简化流程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"续期要取最早期限\">续期要取最早期限</h3><p><strong>续期</strong>的时间预算来自法定与事实两方面的约束。事实约束是核验证据的有效期（渗透测试、认证有效期），法定期限则各有不同——充分性认定每四年必须审查、中国法域下安全评估结果有效期 3 年且可在届满前 60 个工作日申请延长。因此续期排程不能只用「合同到期日」一个字段，而应当取所有相关期限的<strong>最早值</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE VIEW v_contract_deadline AS&#10;SELECT c.contract_id, c.importer_entity, c.status,&#10;       LEAST(&#10;         c.expires_at,&#10;         v.next_review_at,&#10;         t.next_review_at,&#10;         (SELECT (c.effective_at + INTERVAL &#39;4 years&#39;)::date)&#10;       ) AS binding_deadline,&#10;       CASE&#10;         WHEN c.expires_at = LEAST(c.expires_at, v.next_review_at, t.next_review_at)&#10;           THEN &#39;contract_expiry&#39;&#10;         ELSE &#39;assessment_or_verification_expiry&#39;&#10;       END AS reason&#10;FROM contract_instance c&#10;JOIN importer_verification v ON v.verification_id = c.verification_id&#10;LEFT JOIN tia_assessment t ON t.tia_id = c.tia_id&#10;WHERE c.status = &#39;active&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> v_contract_deadline</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">contract_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">importer_entity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       LEAST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">expires_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">next_review_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">next_review_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">effective_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'4 years'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> binding_deadline,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">expires_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> LEAST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">expires_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">next_review_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">next_review_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'contract_expiry'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'assessment_or_verification_expiry'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reason</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> contract_instance c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> importer_verification v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> v</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">verification_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">verification_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tia_assessment t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tia_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tia_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'active'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>取最早值的意义在于：合同还没到期，但接收方的渗透测试报告已过期或 TIA 已到重评窗口时，这条链路的合法性基础实际上已经动摇。把三个期限合成一个 <code>binding_deadline</code> 并给出原因分类，让续期工作变成一份按时间排序的清单，而不是记忆中「好像该续签了」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"终止时的两处遗漏\">终止时的两处遗漏</h3><p><strong>终止</strong>的处理有两处容易遗漏：一是服务结束后接收方必须按控制者选择删除或返还全部个人数据并删除现有副本（除法律要求保留外），二是密钥托管关系的终止——如果此前接收方持有过密钥，终止时必须有明确的密钥销毁或交还动作与回执。把这两项做成终止检查表的一部分，并在关闭合同前要求提供回执，可以避免链路已经停用但数据仍留在接收方手里这种「隐形存量」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>合同是 <strong>TIA 结论 + 核验结论 + 机制判定 + 清单范围的序列化产物</strong>，从结构化输入装配而非空白模板起草。</li>\n<li>模板分两层：<strong>不可变核心条款</strong>（如异议义务，不可谈判）与<strong>受控可变参数</strong>（取值由评估与核验驱动）。</li>\n<li>模块选择由核验得到的角色决定，写进数据库约束可防止结构性错误。</li>\n<li>审批链路由机制类型、最严分类、是否外部主体共同决定；备案是签署后的<strong>必须完成状态</strong>而非可选动作。</li>\n<li>变更按影响面分类：涉及数据范围、接收方或模块的走完整流程；版本化保证「签字版等于评审版」。</li>\n<li>续期排程取合同、核验、评估三者的<strong>最早期限</strong>；终止必须覆盖数据删除/返还与密钥销毁的回执。</li>\n<li>第四章 <a href=\"../transfer-enforce-audit/onward-transfer-control\">再传输（onward）控制</a> 处理合同生效之后的第一个高风险场景：接收方把数据继续往下传。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"传输合同审批与签署","id":"传输合同审批与签署"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：合同是评估结论的序列化产物","id":"核心概念-合同是评估结论的序列化产物"},{"level":2,"text":"参数化模板与模块化条款","id":"参数化模板与模块化条款"},{"level":3,"text":"模块选择必须与角色一致","id":"模块选择必须与角色一致"},{"level":3,"text":"模块选择必须与角色一致","id":"模块选择必须与角色一致"},{"level":2,"text":"审批链路：谁必须签，以及为什么","id":"审批链路-谁必须签-以及为什么"},{"level":2,"text":"变更、续期与终止","id":"变更-续期与终止"},{"level":3,"text":"变更按影响面分流","id":"变更按影响面分流"},{"level":3,"text":"续期要取最早期限","id":"续期要取最早期限"},{"level":3,"text":"终止时的两处遗漏","id":"终止时的两处遗漏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"接收方义务与安全核验","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-data-transfer-compliance/tia-dpia-workflow/importer-obligation-verification"},"next":{"title":"再传输（onward）控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-data-transfer-compliance/transfer-enforce-audit/onward-transfer-control"}}